<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0712_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ralph</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Young people don’t fish no more?\rI can teach you how to fish good, if\nyou wanna swap\fnumbers with me? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s great!\nI’m happy I made a\fyounger homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh...\rMy own kids won’t even gimme their\nnumbers...\rI guess that’s just how young people\nis these days.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? Oh, so you DO wanna be my\nhomie after all?! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you right nearby, let’s just talk\nface-to-face!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I been spendin’ more time with my\n{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} than with my kids.\fThat’s kinda sad, actually.\rCall your mom sometimes too!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I just beat a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}. I told my\nyoungblood, but he laughed and said he\fcould do it easy.\rBoy, he got cocky...\rCall your mom sometimes too!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesterday a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} slipped away\nin front of my youngblood.\fI was feelin’ down about it till he\fshared his Hood Balls with me.\rHahah, that made my day!\rCall your mom sometimes too!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you say to a scrap with me?\nGood, you finna do it!\rFor a youngblood, you real\nagreeable. {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is the spot!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So where you at? I’m waitin’ on you\nto show up on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\rDon’t make your elders wait!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0712_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, how you doin’?\rI’m doin’ absolutely wonderful,\nobviously!\rBut when I say “...absolutely\nwonderful,” is it about fishin’?\fAm I talkin’ about homies?\fWhich one?\rHa ha ha!\nIt’s both, obviously!</language>
	</row>
</body>
